// User Profile for `server` — a bare admin user for headless / server
// installs (the Minimal Profile). Merged under users/core/profile.jsonc, but
// `programs_inherit: false` (ADR 0134) drops User Core's workstation program
// set wholesale, so a headless box carries no GUI userland — the user-layer
// twin of the host's `packages.inherit: false`. One flag instead of the stale
// nine-item `programs_exclude` the VM fixtures still carry.
//
// sudo for administration; no workstation groups (no docker/libvirt/kvm). Bash
// shell, since the zsh tooling is a workstation program the bare user skips.
{
  "shell": "/bin/bash",
  "sudo": true,
  "groups": [],
  "programs_inherit": false,
  "programs": [],
  "ssh_authorized_keys": []
}
